<title>USA: Union City, Ga., yields 5.40 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Union City, Ga., yields 5.40 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it priced $4.640 million of Union City, Ga., general obligation various purpose bonds with a top yield of 5.40 percent in 2016.</p>
</text>
